  "description": "A sleek combination of style, comfort, and power. A lightweight formed aluminum frame provides an effortless and enjoyable ride, and the 7 speed Shimano drivetrain with an easy to use twist shifter gives you the freedom to tackle most terrains. Stay clean and dry with the front & rear fenders, and feel confident and in control with the front & rear disc brakes. The height adjustable saddle and angle adjustable handlebar allow you to find the perfect fit, and the smooth cruiser tires provide a comfortable ride on any surface. The lightweight double-wall alloy wheels are strong and rust resistant, and the front & rear fenders will keep your clothes clean and dry. The 36V 350 watt motor provides the power you need to tackle any challenge, and the handlebar mounted display controller offers 3 distinct power modes. The lithium ion 10.4Ah battery is removable and secured with a key, allowing you to charge it while not installed on the bike. The 26\" Shogun Rockport E-Cruiser bike is perfect for casual rides, commuting and more!",
